  "name": "Dragon's Breath",
  "description": "Dragon's Breath consumes §d§lDraconic Breath§r, which regenerates while not in use. Champion Wyverian can use it underwater. Completely emptying the resource locks the ability until it fully regenerates. Creatures killed by these powers drop no experience.\n \n§d§lDragon's Breath:§r\nHold Primary Ability to project a 32-block stream of corrosive dragon breath. Creatures near the stream take 0.5 magic damage, creatures within 3 blocks of the impact point take 1.5 magic damage, and direct hits take an additional 1 magic damage. Consumes 1 Draconic Breath on the same cadence as the standard breath resource.\n \n§d§lDragon Charge:§r\nToggle firing mode, then hold Primary Ability for 2 seconds without taking damage to charge a draconic projectile. It ruptures on impact in a 4-block radius, dealing 10 magic damage, and dissipates harmlessly after traveling more than 64 blocks. Consumes 10 Draconic Breath."
}
